The smarter, more capable version of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> is finally here, available in <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipados-27/">iPadOS 27</a>, and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-27/">macOS Golden Gate</a>. The updates are limited to developers right now, but there's a lot to look forward to this fall.<br/>
<br/>
